### GetResponse – Key CRUD Actions (API key auth)

- **ListContacts** – `GET /v3/contacts`
- **GetContact** – `GET /v3/contacts/{contactId}`
- **CreateContact** – `POST /v3/contacts`
- **UpdateContact** – `POST /v3/contacts/{contactId}`
- **DeleteContact** – `DELETE /v3/contacts/{contactId}`

- **ListTags** – `GET /v3/tags`
- **CreateTag** – `POST /v3/tags`
- **UpdateTag** – `POST /v3/tags/{tagId}`
- **DeleteTag** – `DELETE /v3/tags/{tagId}`
